IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc10-order-50`

-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), Order 50 (Limited Liability Partnerships Act): TESTS.
-- Every expected value is written beside its assertion from the text of the rule it cites (lines 6424 to 6440 of the text),
-- never copied from the output of the code.

#ASSERT `o 50 r 1 an instrument is the Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "“Act” means the Limited Liability Partnerships Act"
#ASSERT `o 50 r 1 an instrument is the Act` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- another instrument
#ASSERT `o 50 r 1 a reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Limited Liability Partnerships Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "any reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Act"
#ASSERT `o 50 r 1 a reference to a section is a reference to a section in the Limited Liability Partnerships Act` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- some other kind of reference
#ASSERT `o 50 r 2 Order 56 applies to the partnership` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Order 56 does not apply to a limited liability partnership registered under the Act"
#ASSERT `o 50 r 2 Order 56 applies to the partnership` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not such a partnership: the rule does not say
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application must be made by originating application` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under the Act, nothing otherwise provided
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application must be made by originating application` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Unless otherwise provided in the Act or this Order"
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application must be made by originating application` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application under the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` TRUE FALSE `Originating application` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- made by originating application
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` TRUE FALSE `Summons` EQUALS NOTHING -- made by summons: a bare "must", not done
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` TRUE TRUE `Summons` EQUALS NOTHING -- otherwise provided: the duty does not arise
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) the application is made by originating application as it must be` FALSE FALSE `Summons` EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application under the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) these Rules apply to the application subject to this Order` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an application under the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(1) these Rules apply to the application subject to this Order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application under the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order the proceedings to continue as if begun by originating claim` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a winding up originating application under paragraph 3(1)(e) of the Fifth Schedule
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order the proceedings to continue as if begun by originating claim` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- some other application: the "in the case of" fails
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order that` `o 50 r 3(2)(a) that pleadings be delivered or that the originating application or any affidavits stand as pleadings` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (a)
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order that` `o 50 r 3(2)(b) that any persons be added as parties to the proceedings` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (b)
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order that` `o 50 r 3(2)(c) that Order 9 applies with the necessary modifications` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- (c)
#ASSERT `o 50 r 3(2) the Court may order that` `o 50 r 3(2) another order` EQUALS NOTHING -- "in particular" does not close the list
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(1) the document is entitled as it must be` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- entitled in the matter of the partnership and of the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(1) the document is entitled as it must be` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not entitled in the matter of the partnership: a bare "must"
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(1) the document is entitled as it must be` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not entitled in the matter of the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(1) the document is entitled as it must be` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not a document the paragraph speaks of
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(2) the originating application for permission under section 36 is entitled as it must be` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- entitled in the matter of the partnership (if any) in which the applicant was convicted and of the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(2) the originating application for permission under section 36 is entitled as it must be` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not entitled in the matter of the partnership
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(2) the originating application for permission under section 36 is entitled as it must be` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- not entitled in the matter of the Act
#ASSERT `o 50 r 4(2) the originating application for permission under section 36 is entitled as it must be` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not an application for permission under section 36
#ASSERT `o 50 r 5 the Court may by order give such direction as to the proceedings to be taken as it thinks fit` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- at the first case conference
#ASSERT `o 50 r 5 the Court may by order give such direction as to the proceedings to be taken as it thinks fit` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not at the first case conference: the "at" fails
